Description: Lightweight Qt terminal emulator - isodoro Kali build
 QTerminal is a lightweight terminal emulator based on QTermWidget.
 .
 This downstream Kali build includes a per-pane Variable Session
 Manager, automatic Zsh integration and improved bookmark filtering.
 It is independently maintained and is not an official LXQt release.
